#. Extension Asset Libraries heading, ../../manual/editors/preferences/asset_libraries.rst:100.
msgid "Extension Asset Libraries"
msgstr "Resursbibliotek för tillägg"

#. Extension Asset Libraries placement, ../../manual/editors/preferences/asset_libraries.rst:102.
msgid ""
"These asset libraries are added by :ref:`extensions <extensions-"
"asset_libraries>`, they're listed under the extension repository they "
"were installed from."
msgstr ""
"Dessa resursbibliotek läggs till av :ref:`tillägg <extensions-"
"asset_libraries>` och listas under det tilläggsförråd som de installerades "
"från."

#. Remote Asset Library extension behavior, ../../manual/editors/preferences/asset_libraries.rst:105.
msgid ""
"The extension simply adds a :ref:`remote asset library <asset_libraries-"
"remote>` to this list, the assets are downloaded as needed & new assets "
"show up without updating the extension."
msgstr ""
"Tillägget lägger helt enkelt till ett :ref:`fjärranslutet resursbibliotek "
"<asset_libraries-remote>` i den här listan. Resurser hämtas vid behov och "
"nya resurser visas utan att tillägget uppdateras."

#. Installing and removing heading, ../../manual/editors/preferences/asset_libraries.rst:108.
msgid "Installing & Removing"
msgstr "Installera och ta bort"

#. Extension Asset Libraries lifecycle, ../../manual/editors/preferences/asset_libraries.rst:109.
msgid ""
"These are managed the same as :ref:`other extensions <prefs-extensions-"
"install>`, installing adds the library to this list & uninstalling "
"removes it."
msgstr ""
"Dessa hanteras på samma sätt som :ref:`andra tillägg <prefs-extensions-"
"install>`: installation lägger till biblioteket i den här listan och "
"avinstallation tar bort det."

#. Extension Asset Library removal restriction, ../../manual/editors/preferences/asset_libraries.rst:112.
msgid ""
"The library can't be removed from this list, uninstall the extension "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"Biblioteket kan inte tas bort från den här listan. Avinstallera tillägget "
"i stället."

#. Enabling and disabling heading, ../../manual/editors/preferences/asset_libraries.rst:114.
msgid "Enabling & Disabling"
msgstr "Aktivera och inaktivera"

#. Disable Asset Library, ../../manual/editors/preferences/asset_libraries.rst:115.
msgid "Disable a library to hide its assets without uninstalling the extension."
msgstr "Inaktivera ett bibliotek för att dölja dess resurser utan att avinstallera tillägget."

#. Extension repository enablement, ../../manual/editors/preferences/asset_libraries.rst:117.
msgid ""
"Disabling the extension repository hides all of its libraries (they're "
"shown grayed out in the preferences), enabling the repository restores "
"them as they were."
msgstr ""
"Om tilläggsförrådet inaktiveras döljs alla dess bibliotek (de visas "
"nedtonade i inställningarna). När förrådet aktiveras återställs de som de "
"var."

#. Asset Library access token, ../../manual/editors/preferences/asset_libraries.rst:121.
msgid ""
"When a library requires an :ref:`access token <asset-library-access-"
"token>`, enter it in the library's :menuselection:`Advanced` settings."
msgstr ""
"När ett bibliotek kräver en :ref:`åtkomsttoken <asset-library-access-"
"token>` anger du den i bibliotekets inställningar under "
":menuselection:`Avancerad`."
